1
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,360
It's been a while, Wanmei.

2
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,159
Have you been pretty busy lately?

3
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:33,159
I finally got a long vacation.

4
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,280
So I can come here and get some rest.

5
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:37,080
It's still the best here.

6
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,280
So carefree.

7
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,120
Without so much scheming and plotting.

8
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,960
You're joking, Wanmei.

9
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,719
This is the place for you to relax.

10
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:45,199
You're the boss.

11
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,439
As long as you're satisfied,

12
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,520
I'm happy.

13
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:49,960
You should smile more, Wanmei.

14
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,280
See, when you smile,

15
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,280
you look so beautiful.

16
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,759
I really wish I had more reasons to smile.

17
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,159
Xia Xia,

18
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,439
put it on speaker for me.

19
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,879
President Lin.

20
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:04,759
What is it?

21
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,240
The thing you asked me to look into,

22
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,919
the Xiajin Mulberry Leaf Fermentation Technology Patent,

23
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:08,800
I've got news.

24
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,000
Really?

25
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:14,599
Professor Zheng agreed to sell the patent

26
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:15,319
to us.

27
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:16,680
Good.

28
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,680
With this technology,

29
00:03:18,759 --> 00:03:20,800
we can definitely pull off this Comeback.

30
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,159
Wait for me.

31
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:23,159
I'm heading over now.

32
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,719
Should we continue, Wanmei?

33
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,199
Something urgent came up. I'm leaving.

34
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:32,479
Wanmei,

35
00:03:32,479 --> 00:03:33,439
see you next time!

36
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,759
Comeback.

37
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,400
Hey.

38
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,080
Luoluo.

39
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,199
Sang Luo.

40
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,759
Why are you here?

41
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:02,599
The whole industry is eyeing the Xiajin Mulberry Leaf

42
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:03,800
fermentation technology.

43
00:04:04,039 --> 00:04:04,560
You came here

44
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,919
for this patent too, didn't you?

45
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:09,000
But unfortunately,

46
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,919
you're probably too late.

47
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:29,240
What are you so happy about?

48
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,240
Seeing someone lose at cards

49
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,000
makes me happy.

50
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,839
Let me tell you something even better.

51
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,199
We found Auntie Ying.

52
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,319
But she's not doing very well.

53
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,639
It's your fault you have no money!

54
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:05,000
Otherwise, why would I be with that old man

55
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:07,079
and get beaten up like this by his wife?

56
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:09,600
You became someone's mistress,

57
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:11,120
and you think you're in the right?

58
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,800
How many times have I told you?

59
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:14,519
Have you ever listened to me once?

60
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:15,879
It's all because you're useless!

61
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,839
If you had helped me hook up with Cheng An earlier,

62
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,959
I'd be the lady of Gufeng by now!

63
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,800
What a sin!

64
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:23,399
How did I raise such a Debt collector!

65
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,040
Is Pei Yu's family from room 302 here?

66
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:32,199
Please go pay the bill at the outpatient desk.

67
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:54,879
There's two million in here.

68
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:57,519
Enough for you and your daughter to live comfortably.

69
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:01,360
Of course, I'm not giving you this for nothing.

70
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:04,839
I need your help with a few things.

71
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,720
What do you want me to do?

72
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,480
Tell me everything about Cheng An.

73
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,480
Like...

74
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,680
his origins.

75
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,439
Bitch.

76
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,120
How dare you come see me!

77
00:06:34,959 --> 00:06:36,279
As long as you sign this,

78
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,800
I'll disappear immediately.

79
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:47,000
You want to hold my shares?

80
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,800
In your dreams!

81
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,000
I suggest you keep your hands to yourself.

82
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:55,120
Once you've done certain things,

83
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,959
they always leave a trace.

84
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:59,839
Don't think you can fool everyone forever.

85
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,600
What do you mean?

86
00:07:01,639 --> 00:07:02,800
What do I mean?

87
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:03,720
Fang Liangxi,

88
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,240
don't you know?

89
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,920
I suggest you sign it.

90
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,759
Otherwise,

91
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:10,240
I can't guarantee I won't let something slip.

92
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:11,439
Like...

93
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,399
the truth about Cheng An's birth.

94
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,560
Shut up!

95
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:16,920
You've ruled the Cheng family for years,

96
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:19,560
but once certain secrets are exposed,

97
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,120
the consequences...

98
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:24,360
even you couldn't handle them.

99
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:44,120
Then thank you, Old Madam Cheng.

100
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,680
Get out!

101
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:49,079
I don't like how you're talking to me.

102
00:07:49,199 --> 00:07:50,560
How dare you hit me!

103
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,839
Damn right I hit you.

104
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:53,319
A life for a life.

105
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:54,079
If you don't want to go to prison,

106
00:07:54,079 --> 00:07:55,319
you'd better behave yourself.

107
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,160
Here,

108
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,879
Grandma.

109
00:08:25,279 --> 00:08:26,079
Have some water.

110
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,240
Mom,

111
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,199
why did you suddenly faint?

112
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,600
You still have the nerve to show up here!

113
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,799
You Jinx!

114
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,000
What did I do now?

115
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,320
If it weren't...

116
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:47,919
If it weren't...

117
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,679
If it weren't for you killing your dad,

118
00:08:49,679 --> 00:08:51,559
how could the Chengs end up like this?

119
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,720
I don't want to see you.

120
00:08:53,799 --> 00:08:54,720
Get the hell out!

121
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,000
I've been in this business so long,

122
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,159
but this is the first time I've seen

123
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,759
someone pay so many times the price

124
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,960
to buy a collectible in advance.

125
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,840
Forgive me for asking,

126
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:20,799
but this jade pendant...

127
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:22,600
what's so special about it

128
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:24,440
to make you so fixated on it?

129
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,840
It's one of the keepsakes

130
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,960
my father bought for my mother.

131
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,279
It holds the memory of their love.

132
00:09:31,639 --> 00:09:33,399
Many ended up lost over the years.

133
00:09:33,879 --> 00:09:34,600
I want to

134
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:37,039
bring them back as soon as possible.

135
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,200
And what is

136
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,519
your mother's name?

137
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,519
I've handled so many items.

138
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,679
Maybe

139
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,639
I can provide more clues

140
00:09:44,799 --> 00:09:46,519
to help you find the other pieces.

141
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,519
My mother's name

142
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:48,759
is Fang Liangxi.

143
00:09:58,279 --> 00:09:59,080
Sir,

144
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,480
I think you

145
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,840
might have made a mistake.

146
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,039
This jade pendant

147
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:05,240
has different initials engraved on it.

148
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:07,279
It's not your mother's name.

149
00:10:07,759 --> 00:10:08,559
Look.

150
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:09,440
Right here.

151
00:10:17,159 --> 00:10:17,960
AY.

152
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,200
This is...

153
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:21,559
Perhaps

154
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:23,440
this isn't your mother's item.

155
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:26,360
If you want to back out of buying it now,

156
00:10:26,879 --> 00:10:28,120
I completely understand.

157
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,039
It's fine.

158
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,720
I feel a connection to this jade pendant.

159
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,639
I'll buy it.

160
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,240
You got it.

161
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:50,480
When are you giving it to Grandma?

162
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,279
Look.

163
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,919
Here.

164
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:04,600
A

165
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:05,759
Y

166
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:07,960
What does that mean?

167
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,159
I don't know who this AY is.

168
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,600
But it's weird.

169
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,799
Ever since I can remember,

170
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,480
my mom has always loved this jade pendant.

171
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,440
If it didn't belong to my mom,

172
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:27,559
why was it in the Cheng family?

173
00:11:30,559 --> 00:11:31,919
What do you suspect?

174
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:36,559
If you want to find out,

175
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:41,159
there's someone who can help us.

176
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,240
Auntie Ying.

177
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,519
Long time no see.

178
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,120
What do you want from me?

179
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,679
I have a few questions to ask you.

180
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:16,039
We heard about what happened to Pei Yu.

181
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,519
She must have been

182
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,559
traumatized recently,

183
00:12:18,559 --> 00:12:19,919
which is why she gave up on herself.

184
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,759
This psychiatrist is highly

185
00:12:22,759 --> 00:12:23,759
experienced in this area.

186
00:12:23,759 --> 00:12:24,840
Maybe they can help you.

187
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,440
Don't worry about the cost.

188
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,120
It's already been taken care of.

189
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,279
Aren't you just

190
00:12:29,399 --> 00:12:30,600
the third son of the Cheng family?

191
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,919
What other background could you have?

192
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,159
As for my daughter,

193
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,840
I'll figure something out myself.

194
00:12:35,039 --> 00:12:37,120
I don't need you noble Chengs

195
00:12:37,399 --> 00:12:38,440
worrying about her.

196
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:40,200
Don't you want to know

197
00:12:40,759 --> 00:12:42,799
who really hurt your daughter?

198
00:12:46,399 --> 00:12:47,240
Lin Wanmei!

199
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,440
I knew you were framing me!

200
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:50,440
Are you crazy?

201
00:12:50,519 --> 00:12:51,799
No wonder when I wanted to find

202
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:52,519
a son-in-law for Auntie Ying,

203
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,799
Zhuang Sheng, the perfect match,

204
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:55,799
just fell right into my lap.

205
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:57,639
It was you all along!

206
00:12:58,039 --> 00:12:59,399
Why on earth did you do this?

207
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,120
Because you're stupid.

208
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,759
Aren't those the voices of

209
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,559
Cheng Ruolin and Lin Wanmei?

210
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,000
Give that to me!

211
00:13:06,879 --> 00:13:07,679
Auntie Ying,

212
00:13:07,679 --> 00:13:08,399
tell us

213
00:13:08,399 --> 00:13:09,440
what we want to know,

214
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,080
and you'll get the recording.

215
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,559
All I know is that

216
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,440
when Cheng An was three,

217
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,639
he was hospitalized 2 months for a fever.

218
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:27,840
When Mr. and Mrs. Cheng

219
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:29,279
brought him home,

220
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,240
they both looked awful.

221
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:32,919
Cheng An

222
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,679
was also bundled up tightly.

223
00:13:35,399 --> 00:13:36,399
At the time,

224
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:38,000
I thought it was very strange.

225
00:13:38,799 --> 00:13:40,120
Later, when I went to deliver food,

226
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:41,399
I realized

227
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,639
that Cheng An

228
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,480
wasn't the same Cheng An anymore.

229
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,720
What do you mean he wasn't the same?

230
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,840
I tried asking the old madam,

231
00:13:49,559 --> 00:13:50,840
but she said

232
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:52,120
I was being hysterical

233
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,240
and almost fired me.

234
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:57,240
I've always served the Cheng family.

235
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,960
Whether it was the same person or not,

236
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,960
how could I not tell?

237
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,039
Besides,

238
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:03,320
it was just a fever.

239
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,519
Why would he be hospitalized for so long?

240
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,879
Was there anything else strange?

241
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,480
Not long after that,

242
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:12,159
I accidentally

243
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,120
overheard the master and madam arguing.

244
00:14:15,039 --> 00:14:15,840
It sounded like

245
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:17,240
they said they would

246
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,519
take that matter

247
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:21,080
to their graves.

248
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,039
Other than that,

249
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,279
I don't know anything else.

250
00:14:36,679 --> 00:14:37,480
I never expected

251
00:14:39,879 --> 00:14:41,559
that I'm not a child of the Chengs at all.

252
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:46,120
Who exactly am I?

253
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,879
No matter who you are,

254
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,360
I'll always be by your side.

255
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:57,799
Xiaowei.

256
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,639
My biological mother...

257
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,440
What do you think she looks like?

258
00:15:04,919 --> 00:15:06,120
Has she ever looked for me?

259
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,879
What could her name be?

260
00:15:11,279 --> 00:15:12,600
AY.

261
00:15:12,919 --> 00:15:15,320
It might be her initials.

262
00:15:15,679 --> 00:15:16,720
There is no mother

263
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:18,639
who doesn't love her own child.

264
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:22,240
She must be watching over you in secret.

265
00:15:22,919 --> 00:15:24,759
It's just that, for some reason,

266
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,759
she can't be right here with you.

267
00:15:32,759 --> 00:15:35,320
I thought Fang Liangxi always targeted me

268
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,679
because I'm an illegitimate child.

269
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,399
But I never expected

270
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,440
there to be an even bigger secret.

271
00:15:48,919 --> 00:15:49,720
Hello?

272
00:15:49,759 --> 00:15:50,600
I found it.

273
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,320
That jade pendant was indeed custom-made.

274
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,600
It's the only one in the country.

275
00:15:53,799 --> 00:15:55,159
The person who ordered it is

276
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,240
An Yue.

277
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:38,360
Who is An Yue?

278
00:16:41,799 --> 00:16:43,399
I don't know what you're talking about.

279
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,960
Since I've brought up this name,

280
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:53,559
it means

281
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:57,399
I've already found something out.

282
00:17:03,159 --> 00:17:04,960
I really underestimated you.

283
00:17:06,279 --> 00:17:07,279
To think that

284
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:09,440
you even know about this.

285
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,519
Stop pretending.

286
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,759
Just tell me the truth.

287
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:22,680
You're just a bastard.

288
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,319
Why should I tell you?

289
00:17:25,799 --> 00:17:27,240
It was your mother, that bitch!

290
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,880
You people ruined my family!

291
00:17:29,839 --> 00:17:30,759
Xiao Yue...

292
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:33,039
If the child grows up without a father,

293
00:17:33,799 --> 00:17:36,319
they might get bullied in the future.

294
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:37,680
Xiao Yue,

295
00:17:37,799 --> 00:17:38,960
actually, all these years,

296
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,920
I've always been thinking about you.

297
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,240
From now on,

298
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:45,200
let me take care of you.

299
00:17:46,799 --> 00:17:47,599
What?

300
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,119
You're going abroad?

301
00:17:50,039 --> 00:17:51,160
Where are you right now?

302
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,559
I'll come to you right now.

303
00:17:54,599 --> 00:17:55,400
Shixiong,

304
00:17:56,319 --> 00:17:57,519
where are you going?

305
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,200
An is still sick!

306
00:17:59,319 --> 00:18:01,000
He was just calling for his dad.

307
00:18:01,599 --> 00:18:02,799
I'm going out to run an errand.

308
00:18:02,799 --> 00:18:04,039
What errand?

309
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,400
Are you going to abandon us

310
00:18:06,519 --> 00:18:08,000
and leave with that woman?

311
00:18:08,119 --> 00:18:09,680
What nonsense are you talking about?

312
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,640
I already made it clear to you.

313
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,440
There is nothing going on between us.

314
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,279
Fine.

315
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,880
If there's nothing going on,

316
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:18,960
then don't go out today.

317
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:19,680
Enough!

318
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:21,160
Stop being unreasonable!

319
00:18:52,559 --> 00:18:53,480
Yue...

320
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:54,920
Once you leave,

321
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:56,799
when will you come back?

322
00:18:57,279 --> 00:18:58,319
I have nothing left

323
00:18:58,440 --> 00:19:00,039
tying me down here anymore.

324
00:19:00,039 --> 00:19:00,880
How about

325
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,599
I go with you?

326
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:04,519
Once you're settled in,

327
00:19:04,559 --> 00:19:05,920
I'll come back on my own.

328
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:06,720
No need.

329
00:19:07,599 --> 00:19:08,880
I've already asked a friend

330
00:19:09,279 --> 00:19:10,960
to buy a house for me there.

331
00:19:11,119 --> 00:19:11,920
Yue.

332
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:12,960
Brother Cheng.

333
00:19:13,559 --> 00:19:15,400
You and your wife are always welcome

334
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,680
to visit us in the US.

335
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,480
My son is dead.

336
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,759
And you, you bastard, survived.

337
00:19:49,119 --> 00:19:50,799
I had to endure the humiliation

338
00:19:51,839 --> 00:19:54,119
of raising you as my own child.

339
00:19:55,359 --> 00:19:57,319
Whenever I see your face,

340
00:19:58,160 --> 00:20:00,640
I think of that bitch, your mother.

341
00:20:01,559 --> 00:20:03,559
If she hadn't seduced Shixiong,

342
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:05,880
how could my son have died?

343
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:06,960
Shut up!

344
00:20:08,119 --> 00:20:09,759
You should have died with your mother!

345
00:20:09,759 --> 00:20:10,880
I told you to shut up!

346
00:20:13,839 --> 00:20:15,480
You murderer!

347
00:20:15,519 --> 00:20:16,680
I'll kill you!

348
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:42,480
You wouldn't dare.

349
00:20:45,079 --> 00:20:47,200
I knew you wouldn't dare kill me.

350
00:20:51,519 --> 00:20:53,240
You don't deserve to die by my hands.

351
00:20:54,759 --> 00:20:57,160
I'll let the law bring you to justice.

352
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:58,839
The law?

353
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,240
Do you have evidence?

354
00:21:01,839 --> 00:21:03,000
Empty words mean nothing.

355
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:04,880
Who would believe you?

356
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:14,839
How does it feel to kill your own son?

357
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,839
The idea to swap the babies...

358
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,799
...probably wasn't yours, was it?

359
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:24,440
An Yue is dead.

360
00:21:25,039 --> 00:21:27,200
But my child is gone too!

361
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:29,359
Go turn yourself in.

362
00:21:29,599 --> 00:21:30,400
No.

363
00:21:31,279 --> 00:21:32,559
I can't turn myself in.

364
00:21:33,759 --> 00:21:35,839
We still have three kids.

365
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:37,839
Our children...

366
00:21:38,119 --> 00:21:40,519
...can't have a murderer for a mother.

367
00:21:41,039 --> 00:21:41,960
Shixiong.

368
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,400
For the kids' sake...

369
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:45,960
Please, think of something.

370
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:47,079
I'm begging you.

371
00:21:47,079 --> 00:21:49,079
You have to think of a way.

372
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:01,839
We don't have three children.

373
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,079
We have four.

374
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,960
Cheng An is still alive.

375
00:22:09,039 --> 00:22:10,759
An Yue and her son

376
00:22:11,559 --> 00:22:13,920
died in an accidental car crash.

377
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:20,559
Cheng Shixiong kept harassing my mom.

378
00:22:21,359 --> 00:22:23,480
And your jealousy drove you to kill her.

379
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:26,279
Making me call my enemy father for years.

380
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:30,599
You really played a brilliant game.

381
00:22:31,319 --> 00:22:32,759
Take your enemy as your father?

382
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:36,480
I spent so much money raising you.

383
00:22:37,079 --> 00:22:38,440
Sent you to top schools.

384
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:39,839
Dressed you in designer clothes.

385
00:22:39,839 --> 00:22:40,960
I don't owe you anything.

386
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:42,319
You owe me.

387
00:22:42,359 --> 00:22:43,079
It was you.

388
00:22:43,079 --> 00:22:44,720
You killed Shixiong.

389
00:22:47,079 --> 00:22:48,680
Was I really the one who killed him?

390
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:51,759
Cheng An.

391
00:22:52,599 --> 00:22:54,279
I want some water.

392
00:23:02,319 --> 00:23:03,200
Here you go.

393
00:23:06,039 --> 00:23:06,839
Cheng An.

394
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:07,880
I want

395
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:09,119
to sleep for a while.

396
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:09,960
You

397
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:12,400
go play outside by yourself.

398
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:13,759
Okay.

399
00:23:58,839 --> 00:23:59,759
For so many years,

400
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:02,640
you've been using this to torture me.

401
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:04,920
But it wasn't my fault at all.

402
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:08,000
The two of you are murderers,

403
00:24:09,079 --> 00:24:10,599
yet you wanted me to take the blame

404
00:24:10,599 --> 00:24:11,960
and feel guilty for the rest of my life.

405
00:24:13,759 --> 00:24:14,960
Are you even worthy?

406
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:21,279
From now on,

407
00:24:21,759 --> 00:24:23,799
I'm cutting ties with the Cheng family.

408
00:24:25,319 --> 00:24:26,240
Fang Liangxi,

409
00:24:27,839 --> 00:24:29,240
watch yourself.

410
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:32,519
Cheng An...

411
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,880
Don't call me Cheng An anymore.

412
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:34,880
My life

413
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:39,000
feels like a lie.

414
00:25:43,079 --> 00:25:44,519
It's not your fault.

415
00:25:46,279 --> 00:25:48,480
Your mom named you An Yi

416
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:50,000
because she must have hoped you'd

417
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,519
live a peaceful and happy life.

418
00:25:53,599 --> 00:25:55,960
She wouldn't want you to blame yourself,

419
00:25:56,319 --> 00:25:57,119
right?

420
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:00,160
But that woman...

421
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:03,799
she ruined everything.

422
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,680
She destroyed my family.

423
00:26:09,039 --> 00:26:10,319
I don't have a mom anymore.

424
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:20,440
Silly.

425
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:24,039
You still have me.

426
00:26:26,599 --> 00:26:28,240
I'm your family.

427
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:33,319
I'll always, always be by your side.
